## Ordering from JLCPCB

Upload `blinker_card_gerbers.zip] (the file will be on the dom or on the docs folder)
to [jlcpcb.com](https://jlcpcb.com) and use these settings:

| Setting | Value |
|---|---|
| Base Material | FR-4 |
| Layers | 2 |
| Dimensions | 85.6 × 54 mm |
| PCB Qty | 5 |
| PCB Thickness | 1.6mm |
| PCB Color | Black *(looks best as a business card)* |
| Silkscreen | White |
| Surface Finish | HASL (lead-free) — or ENIG for gold |
| Outer Copper Weight | 1 oz |
| Via Covering | Tented |
| Remove Order Number | Specify a location |

> ~$2 for 5 boards + ~£3–5 shipping to the UK. Arrives in about a week.
